      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "THE ADD IS DESTRUCTIVE to the dataset folder (it rewrites sparse/0 and drops new images into images/). It is designed to be safe -- existing poses are pinned and existing faces are left alone -- but if you want to keep a pristine copy, copy the dataset folder first.\n\nRunning it TWICE just adds more views (hires_ numbering continues); it does not duplicate.\n\nIf views fail to register, the node tells you instead of writing a broken dataset. Fixes, in order:\n  1. lower movement_scale (renders stay closer to what the pano really shows)\n  2. edge_mode=stretch (no invented pixels)\n  3. raise max_num_features\n  4. lower abs_pose_min_num_inliers\n\nmatch_stride: raise to 2-3 if your base dataset has many hundreds of frames and matching is slow. Neighbouring pano frames are near-duplicates, so every 2nd still ties the views in."
      ]
    },
